#: ../../plugins.rst:182
msgid ""
"``plugin()`` is the public descriptor. ``Plugin::build`` keeps the "
"unloaded ``Badge`` as a prototype and clones it for every session, so "
"sessions never share state. ``info`` names the plugin and declares its "
"hooks. ``load`` reads the configuration through "
"``LoadContext::read_config``. That call bounds its size, declares the "
"file as a dependency and fingerprints the bytes. ``load`` then checks the "
"setting and keeps it in the value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../plugins.rst:188
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "``plugin()`` is the public descriptor. ``load`` reads bounded UTF-8 "
#| "configuration, checks its type and size, and allocates ``Settings`` in "
#| "the session. The source hook checks expansion size before allocating. "
#| "It replaces every marker, including markers inside code blocks; this "
#| "is a text transformation, not a markup parser."
msgid ""
"The source hook returns ``Cow::Borrowed`` when the text has no marker, so "
"unchanged text is never copied. It checks the expanded size against "
"``MAX_PLUGIN_TEXT`` before allocating. It replaces every marker, "
"including markers inside code blocks. This is a text transformation, not "
"a markup parser."
msgstr ""
"``plugin()`` सार्वजनिक descriptor है। ``load`` सीमित आकार की UTF-8 "
"configuration पढ़ता है, type और आकार जाँचता है और session में "
"``Settings`` के लिए memory लेता है। Source hook memory लेने से पहले "
"विस्तार का आकार जाँचता है। यह code blocks के भीतर के markers भी बदलता है। "
"यह पाठ का रूपांतरण है, markup parser नहीं।"

#: ../../plugins.rst:193
msgid ""
"The HTML hook escapes the label and inserts it before the last closing "
"body tag. It uses ``assets_url`` supplied by the host, so nested pages "
"link to the right CSS. This small example expects literal lowercase "
"closing head and body tags. A plugin that rewrites arbitrary HTML should "
"use a suitable parser and state its contract."
msgstr ""
"HTML hook लेबल को escape करके आख़िरी closing body tag से पहले डालता है। "
"Host का दिया ``assets_url`` उपयोग करने से nested pages में भी सही CSS "
"link बनता है। यह छोटा उदाहरण head और body के closing tags को ठीक इसी "
"lowercase रूप में चाहता है। मनमाना HTML बदलने वाला plugin उचित parser "
"इस्तेमाल करे और अपना contract बताए।"

