#: ../../plugins.rst:241
msgid ""
"A linked plugin's identity in the cache is its ID, its version and the "
"host binary's own build identity, because its code is part of the host. "
"Rebuilding the binary rebuilds the affected output. Linked code runs in "
"the host process, so a panic or a hang in a hook reaches the build. We "
"serve a plugin as a program when it should be isolated."
msgstr ""

