#: ../../plugins.rst:250
msgid ""
"A plugin value *is* one build's session. The host creates a fresh session "
"per selected plugin per build, from the prototype. It drops the session "
"when the build ends, whether it succeeded or failed. ``Drop`` replaces an "
"unload callback: we close files or connections there."
msgstr ""

#: ../../plugins.rst:255
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Use ``read_plugin_config`` and ``read_plugin_file`` during load. They "
#| "fingerprint the bytes actually read and declare dependencies. Keep "
#| "loaded state unchanged throughout the build. If you read other files "
#| "yourself, declare their paths in ``session.dependencies`` and append a "
#| "fingerprint of the loaded values to ``session.cache_key``. Append "
#| "selected environment values there too. Do not erase the fingerprints "
#| "recorded by the SDK helpers or depend on undeclared changing data."
msgid ""
"Use ``LoadContext::read_config`` and ``read_file`` during load. They "
"fingerprint the bytes actually read and declare dependencies. Keep loaded "
"state unchanged throughout the build. If we read other files ourselves, "
"we declare their paths with ``declare_dependency`` and add a fingerprint "
"of the loaded values with ``add_cache_key``. Selected environment values "
"go there too. The context only appends, so the fingerprints the helpers "
"recorded cannot be erased. A plugin must not depend on undeclared "
"changing data."
msgstr ""
"Load के दौरान ``read_plugin_config`` और ``read_plugin_file`` इस्तेमाल "
"करें। वे वास्तव में पढ़े गए bytes की fingerprint दर्ज करते हैं और "
"dependencies घोषित करते हैं। लोड की गई स्थिति पूरे बिल्ड में न बदलें। अगर "
"दूसरी फ़ाइलें खुद पढ़ते हैं तो उनके paths ``session.dependencies`` में "
"दें और पढ़े गए मूल्यों की fingerprint ``session.cache_key`` में जोड़ें। "
"उपयोग किए गए environment values भी जोड़ें। SDK की fingerprints न मिटाएँ "
"और बिना घोषित बदलते डेटा पर निर्भर न रहें।"

#: ../../plugins.rst:263
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The host includes identity, configuration, dependencies, cache key, "
#| "builder, language and generated assets in cache invalidation. Each "
#| "build gets private sessions. Reading workers serialize callback "
#| "access; callbacks need not be thread safe. Native callbacks cannot be "
#| "interrupted by a process deadline. Installed programs have a deadline "
#| "per whole request, including pipe writes."
msgid ""
"The host includes identity, configuration, dependencies, cache key, "
"builder, language and generated assets in cache invalidation. Hooks take "
"``&mut self``. When reading workers share a session, the host serializes "
"calls through a ``Mutex``, so plugins need no synchronization. Installed "
"programs have a deadline per whole request, including pipe writes."
msgstr ""
"Host cache invalidation में पहचान, configuration, dependencies, cache "
"key, builder, भाषा और generated assets शामिल करता है। हर बिल्ड के निजी "
"sessions होते हैं। Reading workers callbacks को क्रम से चलाते हैं, इसलिए "
"callbacks का thread-safe होना आवश्यक नहीं। Process deadline से native "
"callback को रोका नहीं जा सकता। स्थापित programs के पूरे request पर समय "
"सीमा होती है, जिसमें pipe writes भी शामिल हैं।"

